        The standard Facebook business page cover photo displays at <strong>820 × 312 pixels</strong> on desktop and <strong>640 × 360 pixels</strong> on smartphones. Designing on an <strong>820 × 360 pixel canvas</strong> (or double resolution at <strong>1640 × 720 pixels</strong>) with a central 640 × 312 pixel safe zone guarantees full visibility across all devices.
