    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3 class="faq-question">Why does Facebook crop my cover photo on mobile phones?</h3>
      <p class="faq-answer">
        Facebook uses different aspect ratios across devices. Desktop uses a wide rectangular frame (~2.6:1), while mobile devices use a taller 16:9 frame. Mobile displays crop the left and right edges of wide banners, while desktop displays crop the top and bottom of tall banners.
      </p>
